WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:11.220
When I got my acceptance to MIT, it was on Pi Day, which is March 14, and the admissions come out at 1:59, because pi is 3.14159.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.300
I logged on to the webpage...

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.200
And I'm locked in my room. I'm a nervous wreck.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.680
And I started reading the line and I started screaming.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.980
All I saw was "It is our pleasure," and I just lost it. I jumped up...

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.800
My brother was like, "Is that good or is that bad?"

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.800
They didn't know if it was a good sign or a bad sign.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.500
So they started screaming and jumping up and down.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.440
And when I ran out, I kept saying, "I'm going to MIT," and then they began screaming and my mom cried.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.840
There was a lot of screaming, a lot of screaming when I got accepted to MIT.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.940
It was good. It was the best day of my life.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.900
 

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.840
When I received my acceptance letter from MIT, I was a bit shocked at first.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.560
I couldn't believe it. It was amazing.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.720
I didn't really expect to get in, to be honest.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.040
Because I didn't think I could get in.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:53.700
 

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:01.600
The biggest fear that I had about MIT was that I wasn't going to be smart enough, or like the other freshmen.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.560
I felt that they would be smarter than me.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.440
 

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:12.380
And after attending CPW, I definitely found people that were just like me.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.440
I came here during Campus Preview Weekend.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.520
I came up here for CPW and I had a great time.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:22.340
I got to see a lot of the student life here, and a lot of the different activities that I could choose to be a part of.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:26.240
So, during my CPW experience, it was my first impression of MIT,

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:31.960
and I learned that everyone here is very relaxed, laid back, they're very comfortable with each other,

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.760
and there's a lot of friendship here.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:38.580
I think one of the surprises that I found was just how cool everyone here is

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:39.580
and how much fun they are.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.440
I chose MIT because...mostly because of the people here.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.120
Just fantastic people, from all different backgrounds, and they just really expand your world.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:52.500
I chose MIT because when I came to CPW, I met people who were fun.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.520
During CPW, I really had the time of my life. There's so much going on.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.640
That's what I'm looking forward to. That's what I chose MIT for.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.620
And that's, you know, the reason I decided to come here.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.140
That sold it for me.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:09.500
I realized this was the only place I wanted to go.

